DESCRIPTION:Topic\nThe Psychology of Spending\nSynopsis\nOur spending habit
	s are often influenced by psychological factors\, such as emotions\, biase
	s\, and social pressures. \n \nThis session will entail: \n1. The psycholo
	gy of spending\n2. How to identify your spending triggers\n3. How to overc
	ome impulse buying\, and make mindful spending choices.\nSpeaker\nUsha Mal
	lya \nLink : https://www.linkedin.com/in/usha-mallya-70a3065/\n \n\n\n____
	__________________________________________________________________________
	________________________________\n\nOption 1 – If you are joining via a 
	laptop or mobile device through the application:\n1. Click on this hyperli
	nk: Webex Meeting Link <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m0df72a743c86
	50b021acf63ad199c89c> \n2. Use a headset for a better experience\n*Visit h
	ere <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/SitePages/fow/digital-too
	ls.aspx?market=Singapore&category=Communication> to find out more about We
	bex \n\nMeeting password: cWJmnYPp953 (only if asked)\n\nOption 2 – If y
	ou are joining via Cisco VC Equipment:\nUse the Touch Panel to dial in\n1.
	 Press the "Call" icon\n2. Dial 25108911030@dbs.webex.com <mailto:25108911
	030@dbs.webex.com>  into the search bar and press "Call" \n3. If you are t
	he host\, enter your 6-digit one-time Host KEY. Click here to see how to r
	etrieve your Host KEY <https://dbs1bank.sharepoint.com/sites/sgFOW/Shared%
	20Documents/Forms/AllItems.aspx?viewpath=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Docum
	ents&id=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides%2FWebEx%2FUser%20Gu
	ide%5FHost%5FPIN%2Epdf&viewid=1b23a731%2D8c47%2D42f0%2Dbd84%2Db790e52deffa
	&parent=%2Fsites%2FsgFOW%2FShared%20Documents%2FGuides%2FWebEx> \n\nOption
	 3 – If you are joining via a laptop through the Web browser: \nFor exte
	rnal parties who do not wish to download the application \n1. Click on thi
	s hyperlink: Webex Meeting Link <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m0df
	72a743c8650b021acf63ad199c89c> \n2. Click on ‘Cancel button’ if a popu
	p ‘Open Webex?' appears \n3. Click on ‘Join from your browser’ \n4. 
	Enter your Name and Email Address and join the meeting \n\nClick here <htt
	ps://help.webex.com/en-us/article/nrbgeodb/Join-a-Webex-Meeting#id_135013>
	 to find out more\n\nOption 4 – If you are dialling in via phone (audio 
	only):\n*Toll charges / Long distance charges may apply.\nNote if you are 
	the host\, please use either Option 1 or 2 to start the meeting.\nSingapor
	e +65-3157-6442 <tel:%2B65-3157-6442\,\,1%23\,%23> \nHong Kong +852-3018-6
	828 <tel:%2B852-3018-6828\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Mumbai +91-22-6480-0114 
	<tel:%2B91-22-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nIndia\, Hyderabad +91-40-6480-0114
	 <tel:%2B91-40-6480-0114\,\,1%23\,%23> \nTaiwan +886-2-5594-0839 <tel:%2B8
	86-2-5594-0839\,\,1%23\,%23> \n\nMeeting Number: 2510 891 1030#\nGlobal ca
	ll-in numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php> \n\n\nUseful Li
	nks:\nNeed help? Contact Webex Support Team! <mailto:webexsupport@dbs.com>
